    "title_en": "One more Sine-Gordon soliton in AdS",
    "abstract_en": "In previous work arXiv:2604.00160, we found soliton solutions in a deformation of the sine-Gordon theory in AdS spacetime that, in the infinite-radius limit, reduce to single-soliton solutions in flat space. In this paper, we find another single soliton solution that has no analog in flat space.",
